  "id": "body-rocking",
  "term": "body rocking",
  "definition": "Body rocking is a standing postural task in which a person deliberately rocks the body at the ankle joint in the sagittal plane, meaning forward and backward while upright. In this context, it is used to study how posture is coordinated and controlled during standing.",
